# Architecture

Before architectural changes: read `DEVELOPMENT_RULES.md`, `AGENTS.md`, and `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`.

## Stack

React + Vite + TS · NestJS + TS · MariaDB + Prisma · Redis · BullMQ · Docker · Nginx

## Surfaces

- `apps/website` — public marketing / acquisition
- `apps/client-portal` — customer tenant app
- `apps/admin` — staff CRM / ops / RBAC
- `apps/api` — sole NestJS system of record (REST + WS + workers)
- AI — `packages/ai` + API (not a separate business DB)

## Boundaries

- `apps/*` → `packages/*` only; apps never import apps
- Domain logic in packages; apps stay thin
- Workspace imports: `@agency/*`
- pnpm only; Node >= 22; TypeScript strict; avoid `any`
- External systems only via provider interfaces (never vendor SDKs in React or controllers)
- Providers: `LLMProvider`, `EmbeddingProvider`, `VectorStore`, `PaymentProvider`, `HostingProvider`, `DomainProvider`, `DnsProvider`, `EmailProvider`, `StorageProvider`
- Document env vars in `.env.example`; never commit secrets
- Money: `amountCents` + ISO `currency`
- Update docs when contracts change; follow `docs/ROADMAP.md` phase order
